  "prompts": {
    "image": "Live-action photographic insert of the SAME hands and paper bundle in reference 1. Reference 1 fixes the pose, paper, writing, hands, clothing and light. Reference 2 fixes real photographic texture and color; do not paint or illustrate anything. Move the real camera closer to chest and hands; face is out of frame, small clipped paper bundle occupies approximately 65 percent of frame width. Naturally aged hands, realistic pores and soft fine hairs, imperfect fingernails, natural uneven skin with gentle shadows, NOT exaggerated grooves or etched linework. Hand at viewer left lightly holds the metal clip, hand at viewer right supports lower edge. Card has the exact same small blue handwriting: 'VanSabe' then 'Niña Mala', and exactly SIX simple orange outline flame doodles in one row. Doodles are ink drawn on paper, no fill gradient, no cartoon treatment of surrounding scene. Ordinary slightly creased off-white paper with subtle fibers, no heavy grunge. Soft brown fabric jacket and navy zip layer behind, softly blurred burgundy checked scarf upper edge. Photographed using 85mm lens at f/4, moderate natural contrast, restrained warm practical light from the park. Keep the paper and fingers in focus, rest gently optical blur. It must look like a real photograph, not a painting, not 3D, no swirly cloth textures, no sharpening halos, no plastic skin, no added objects, no captions. Vertical 9:16.",
    "endFrameDescription": "Kamera odjeżdża od kartki do dokładnej kompozycji Start Frame marian-dotarlo. Ten sam Marian, chwyt obu dłoni, klips, napisy i sześć płomieni. Przejście trwa 3 sekundy.",
    "animation": "0.0–2.7s: in one continuous shot, the camera smoothly dollies backward from the close view of the clipped handwritten card, revealing the same hands, torso, face and seated Marian on the bench, and arrives at the exact supplied End Frame composition. Marian holds the card at the same chest position and keeps both hands gripping it naturally; he does not extend or retract his arms to fake the camera movement. 2.7–3.0s: the camera settles and Marian maintains a quiet closed-mouth half-smile. Secondary motion: subtle breathing only. Continuity: preserve VanSabe, Niña Mala, exactly six orange flame doodles, the single binder clip, both hands, clothing, parcel and dusk lighting. Avoid cuts, fades, dissolves, morphs, duplicated fingers, changing letters, paper rotation, speech or added captions."
